<title>GERMANY: Depfa 97 DVFA EPS to rise to at least 6 dmk.</title>
<headline>Depfa 97 DVFA EPS to rise to at least 6 dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Phandbrief- und Hypothekenbank AG (Depfa) said on Wednesday it expected DVFA earnings per share to climb to at least six marks this year from 5.12 marks in 1996.</p>
<p>Earnings per share under DVFA in 1995 were 4.59 marks.</p>
<p>Depfa chief executive Thilo Koepfler told a news conference the bank aimed to increase its return on equity on an after-tax basis to between nine and 10 percent by 1998 compared with 7.3 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
